- `/vendi` Region is a canonical Select, required, with no free-text fallback.
  It is disabled unless the registry read succeeded non-empty; loading, empty
  success and read error are three distinguishable states. One wizard visit
  performs at most one registry read (promise held in a ref, Strict-Mode safe),
  and the Cantina path performs none because wine identity stays read-only.
  Step `Identificazione` cannot be left without a canonical Region: the guard is
  in the hook, not only in the markup.
