  applied and the current Region is preserved, empty included. No fuzzy
  matching, typo correction, translation or alias was introduced. Other AI
  fields are unchanged.
- `/esplora` starts listings and registry reads together and isolates the
  registry: an unexpected rejection is caught, so a registry failure or an empty
  registry never hides listings and never disables ordinary text search — the
